        "subject": "LU-20689 utils: Refuse any size containing '-'",
        "message": "LU-20689 utils: Refuse any size containing '-'\n\nllapi_parse_size() accepted a negative size with leading spaces,\nsuch as \" -1\", and passed it to strtoull(), which wrapped it to\nULLONG_MAX.  Refuse any size containing '-' instead.\n\nFixes: c42ad03831f4 (\"LU-960 utils: bad stripe count report, and validate stripe size\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity env=ONLY=56Fc\nSigned-off-by: Xiao Yang <xyang@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5\nChange-Id: I4c732dbb94086e000cac97889425c4451176aa6d\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
